Home-made trial image (2026-11-20) - NOT a vendor build.
  mcb_1118prog_seq0923_pinks_no13.bin
Made here with tools/fw_waveform.py ("plan C").
Program: the vendor's FW_261118 trial program (mcb_two_pinks(0a,0c).bin),
byte for byte. So it ignores a waveform saved in the board's SPI flash,
and it carries the vendor's other changes too, including command 0x2A.
How it behaves with Conductor shows and the 0x1F delay tables has not
been checked here yet.
Table: FW_260923's 14 other colours and timing (header total 662, steps
copied exactly), plus the 11/9 "No.13" pinks:
  colour 0x0A <- pink red No.13    (FW_261109/mcb_pink_red_0_16.bin, colour 12)
  colour 0x0C <- pink purple No.13 (FW_261109/mcb_pink_purple_0_7.bin, colour 12)
with only their step 0 level-0 time grown to reach 662 (no step split).
Only the 16 table entries and the 2 header total bytes differ from
FW_261118. The size and everything else (program, header date / mask /
key / settings, tail) are FW_261118's.
Why: FW_261118B (FW_260923's program with the pinks patched into its
table) showed six colours on board 03, and so did plain FW_260923 on that
board. Read from the program statically (not measured): the FW_260923
program prefers a waveform saved in the board's SPI flash to its built-in
table; the vendor's later trial programs do not read it. A board that
holds such a saved waveform keeps it - flashed back to FW_260923 it shows
six colours again until the saved waveform is erased (command 0x24, not
in our tools yet).
The table header keeps FW_261118's date stamp (2026-11-18).
Unproven on hardware: try it on a spare board first.
Reproduce (from the repo root; it refuses while the .bin exists - delete
it first or add --force):
  python tools/fw_waveform.py transplant --base "FW/archive/FW_261118/mcb_two_pinks(0a,0c).bin" --total 662 --set 0=FW/FW_260923/fw2029.09.23/MCB_16_0923.bin:0 --set 1=FW/FW_260923/fw2029.09.23/MCB_16_0923.bin:1 --set 2=FW/FW_260923/fw2029.09.23/MCB_16_0923.bin:2 --set 3=FW/FW_260923/fw2029.09.23/MCB_16_0923.bin:3 --set 4=FW/FW_260923/fw2029.09.23/MCB_16_0923.bin:4 --set 5=FW/FW_260923/fw2029.09.23/MCB_16_0923.bin:5 --set 6=FW/FW_260923/fw2029.09.23/MCB_16_0923.bin:6 --set 7=FW/FW_260923/fw2029.09.23/MCB_16_0923.bin:7 --set 8=FW/FW_260923/fw2029.09.23/MCB_16_0923.bin:8 --set 9=FW/FW_260923/fw2029.09.23/MCB_16_0923.bin:9 --set 10=FW/archive/FW_261109/mcb_pink_red_0_16.bin:12 --set 11=FW/FW_260923/fw2029.09.23/MCB_16_0923.bin:11 --set 12=FW/archive/FW_261109/mcb_pink_purple_0_7.bin:12 --set 13=FW/FW_260923/fw2029.09.23/MCB_16_0923.bin:13 --set 14=FW/FW_260923/fw2029.09.23/MCB_16_0923.bin:14 --set 15=FW/FW_260923/fw2029.09.23/MCB_16_0923.bin:15 --out FW/archive/FW_261119/mcb_1118prog_seq0923_pinks_no13.bin
